                        "line": 1,
                        "button": "•",
                        "description": "Any number of Long Fangs can each have their boltgun replaced with one of the following:<ul><li>1 grav-cannon</li><li>1 heavy bolter</li><li>1 heavy flamer</li><li>1 lascannon</li><li>1 missile launcher</li><li>1 multi-melta</li><li>1 plasma cannon</li></ul>"
