                        "datasheetId": "000000326",
                        "line": 2,
                        "button": "•",
                        "description": "The Long Fang Pack Leader’s boltgun can be replace with one of the following<ul><li>1 flamer</li><li>1 grav-gun</li><li>1 meltagun</li><li>1 plasma gun</li><li>1 plasma pistol</li></ul>"
                    },
