        {
            "name": "Armorium Cherub",
            "legend": "",
            "description": "Once per battle, after making a Hit roll for a model in this unit, you can change that roll to an unmodified 6.<br><br><b>Designer’s Note:</b> Place an Armorium Cherub token next to the unit, removing it once this ability has been used.",
